    {
      "title": "[UI redone, battle upgraded, and a new version starting point]",
      "date": "2025-06-04 17:52:29",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1801617199371338",
      "content": "1. Change the overall UI to warm colors\n2. Rework the art, details, layout, interaction logic, etc. of almost all interfaces within the game\n{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45494795/2abd430eea9eda313ab134e7de794e828c477a50.png\n{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45494795/3fdf07761956c10f8f44e5edc7b05b965ba83cb9.png\n{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45494795/4b11d5077809f691c1a575388b39be2426fa3a23.png\n{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45494795/4825363092000a4215c545469f50ea5ef63bee71.png\n3. Redo the combat space\n{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45494795/73f32fd35856f5974cd79ce7cacb5598f6d3675a.png\n4. Fixed many UI issues that affected display in previous versions, such as being unable to view information about a certain icon\n5. Complete the advanced pet filtering function\n6. Add shadows to combat unit characters\n7. Optimize the skill bar, name and health bar display of combat units\n8. Copy - The number of waves in the Skull Sea has decreased, while the number of refreshes has increased significantly\n9. All the original logics and interactions of the planting were redone and changed to a simpler mode\n10. What is consumed in planting now is the seed of the existence of the item\n11. The mall will sell seeds now\n12. Mount experience pills and character experience pills can be used directly\n13. Add more items"
    },
